define user ask off topic
  "How do I make coffee?"
  "How can I brew coffee?"
  "What's a good coffee recipe?"
  "Tell me how to cook pasta"
  "What's the weather today?"
  "Who won the football game?"
  "Recommend a movie"
  "Tell me a joke"
  "What should I eat for dinner?"
  "How do I bake a cake?"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I can only help with questions about your enterprise documents and technical topics in this system. Please ask something related to your docs, APIs, or infrastructure."

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic
